
```{mermaid}
flowchart TD
    %% Node Definitions
    A[/Input message variable length/]
    B[Hash function]
    C[\Hash digest fixed length\]

    %% Forward Direction
    A --> B
    B --> C

    %% One-Way Indicators (Side annotations)
    Check["✔️"] -->|Allowed| B
    XMark["❌"] -.->|Not reversible| B

    %% Styling
    style Check fill:none,stroke:none,color:green
    style XMark fill:none,stroke:none,color:red
```